    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-editorial art direction, disciplined cyan/red signaling, and a compelling desktop hierarchy. However, tablet/mobile become excessively tall and dense; the mobile red panel feels cramped, with awkward wrapping and a partially cut-off footer. The global header also degrades: navigation is visibly clipped, the brand disappears on mobile, and tiny low-contrast labels weaken polish and orientation.",
